                "text": "PFAS exposure can cause serious health effects, & these harmful chemicals have been found in the drinking water of over 50 cities across WI. We need to ensure safe drinking water for all. \n\nThat's why I'm calling on @POTUS to include funding to address PFAS in his FY 2023 budget. https://t.co/VgMWyUBWsB",
