                "text": "Wisconsinites in rural communities rely on the @USPS to stay connected and to deliver paychecks, medication, local news, and more. \n\nToday, I'll vote to pass the Postal Service Reform Act to preserve this vital institution for generations to come. https://t.co/U1J8AbUjri",
