                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our veterans served with honor and deserve the very best we have to offer. \n\nToday I voted for the bipartisan Honoring our PACT Act to expand access to health care to over 3.5 million veterans exposed to toxic substances and ensure they receive the care & benefits they\u2019ve earned. https://t.co/sgFYASvFvd",
