                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Twelve years ago the #AffordableCareAct became law, helping millions of Americans gain access to affordable health care. Today, I joined @SenBradPfaff to call for action to continue building on this progress by expanding access to quality care and lowering health costs for all. https://t.co/KIJRQRndgj",
