                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "During the pandemic, millions of patients turned to their local pharmacies for critical health services like testing, vaccination, & more. We need to preserve this access to care & today @RepMcKinley, @RepBarragan, @RepBuddyCarter & I introduced a bipartisan bill to do just that. https://t.co/2b4q2OUgBH",
