                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In recent years the cost for insulin and other necessary diabetic treatments has skyrocketed, forcing too many Wisconsinites to ration life-saving medication. \n\nToday, I'll vote to pass the Affordable Insulin Now Act to cap out-of-pocket costs for insulin at $35 per month. https://t.co/eWhaMpVjN5",
